OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe clear intervals around at first
OL,7,Fbefore it will turn rather cloudy with
OL,8,Fthe odd patch of drizzle overnight.
OL,9,FSome clearer spells are likely to
OL,10,Freturn from the north into Monday
OL,11,Fmorning. Frost-free with gentle winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FMonday promises to be a fine
OL,14,Fday with early cloud soon breaking to
OL,15,Fgive some sunny spells. Perhaps a
OL,16,Flittle more cloud developing later.
OL,17,FTemperatures nearer average, and
OL,18,Fbecoming breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
