OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FLots
OL,6,Fof dry weather is expected through the
OL,7,Fperiod, with bright or sunny spells.
OL,8,FHowever, areas of cloud will arrive
OL,9,Ffrom the east as winds freshen,
OL,10,Fbringing the odd shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
